    "text": "The board lists one percentage of tarrifs for the each country. Some countries impose blanket tarrifs, most don't and the tarrifs depend on the items being imported. For example Trump listet 50% tarrifs for South Korea. They have a trade agreement with the US, no blanket tarrifs and have continuously lowered the tarrifs because of the agreement. Same for basically all the other countries. So this chart is misleading at best.",
